SUMMARY:Apple Dumpling Day
DESCRIPTION:Join us Sunday\, September 27 from 12-4PM at Visitation Hotel for our second annual Apple Dumpling Day\, a celebration filled with sweet treats\, live music\, family games\, local vendors\, and more. Enjoy our classic apple dumplings\, sip apple-inspired drinks\, and experience a day that brings together the best of Frederick’s history\, community\, and good old-fashioned fun.
