SUMMARY:Calvary UMC's Community Concert Series Presents a Violin\, Clarinet\, and Piano Trio
DESCRIPTION:Calvary United Methodist Church (calvaryumc.org/concerts) located in historic downtown Frederick presents this Andrew Sords\, violinist\, Eric Schultz\, clarinetist\, and Elizabeth DeMio\, pianist. This dynamic trio will perform showpieces by Shostakovich\, Brahms\, Khachaturian\, and more. Don’t miss this afternoon of electrifying and spirited music! This concert is sponsored in part by The Frederick Arts Council\, The Delaplaine Foundation\, and the William E. Cross Foundation. www.AndrewSords.com www.EricSchultz.com https://www.cim.edu/faculty/elizabeth-demio
