DTSTAMP:20260927T150537Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260927
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260928
SUMMARY:Celebration Cellars Wine Dinner at Union Mills Public House
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the harvest season with an exclusive\, multi-course culinary experience matching exceptional regional wines with locally inspired plates. Join Celebration Cellars Winery and Chef Niko of Union Mills Public House for an intimate\, wine dinner in the heart of Frederick. Chef Niko has curated a custom 4 course menu designed to perfectly complement the distinct flavor profiles of Celebration Cellars’ premium local releases. Whether you are a dedicated wine club member\, a local foodie\, or simply looking for an exceptional Sunday evening out\, this dinner offers a unique taste of Maryland’s vibrant culinary scene. Secure your seats today on Eventbrite to experience this premier autumn food and wine pairing.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/celebration-cellars-wine-dinner-at-union-mills-public-house/26069/
