SUMMARY:Dynamic Automotive’s 18th Annual Car Show
DESCRIPTION:Join Dynamic Automotive for its 18th Annual Car Show! Enjoy an afternoon of fun for all ages featuring a diverse display of classic\, custom\, and modern vehicles\, local food vendors\, and a 50/50 raffle. All proceeds from the event benefit Habitat for Humanity Frederick County to help support safe\, affordable housing and critical home repairs for local families. Vehicle owners interested in participating can register on-site starting at 10:00 AM on the day of the event. Come out to enjoy great cars and support a fantastic local cause!
