SUMMARY:Knine Rescue Adoption Event
DESCRIPTION:Dogs? Beer? What better way to spend your Sunday afternoon! Knine Rescue is a non-profit 501(3)c organization dedicated to animal care and protection through helping shelters find forever homes for their rescues. Learn more here. Meet the pups in our taproom - Knine Rescue will be bringing adorable puppies and lovable adult dogs\, ready to be your new best friend! Get pre-approved for adoption here.
